    "title": "Crime Stoppers: Vehicle theft, property damage, and evidence tampering - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shajaka Shelton ,\n1 hours ago\nLANSING, Mich. (WLNS) — This week on Crime Stoppers, police need your help identifying people who stole a vehicle and, separately, damaged property in Old Town, as well as tracking down a man wanted on a warrant out of Jackson for multiple crimes.\nIf you have information regarding the cases below, call Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan at (517) 483-STOP. You can remain anonymous.\nThose who contact Crime Stoppers with information can receive an award of up to $1,000.\nVehicle Theft (Crime Stoppers of Mid-Michigan) The Lansing Police Department is asking for assistance in identifying a suspect who stole a vehicle from the 5100 block of N Grand River Avenue on Aug. 15, 2025.",
